<div>
    <h3>回望苦难，致敬辉煌 | 学校举办第九期资助育人·悦读会</h3>
   <div class="time"><span>发布时间：</span>2026-04-27 09:50:10<span>来源：</span>
    <span> 点击：</span><script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1482657449, 33202)</script></div>

    
    <div id="vsb_content"><div class="v_news_content">
<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: Calibri Light;  --docx-minorhansi-font: Calibri;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #44546A;  --docx-lt2-color: #E7E6E6;  --docx-accent1-color: #4874CB;  --docx-accent2-color: #EE822F;  --docx-accent3-color: #F2BA02;  --docx-accent4-color: #75BD42;  --docx-accent5-color: #30C0B4;  --docx-accent6-color: #E54C5E;  --docx-hlink-color: #0026E5;  --docx-folhlink-color: #7E1FAD;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: Times New Roman;}.docx p, p.docx_1 {  min-height: 28pt;  line-height: 28pt;  text-indent: 44.00pt;  text-align: justify;}.docx p, p.docx_1 span {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 16.00pt;  font-size: 16.00pt;}.docx table, table.docx_3 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}p.docx_2 {  background-color: #FFFFFF;  min-height: 28pt;  line-height: 28pt;  text-align: left;  text-indent: 44.00pt;}p.docx_2 span {  font-family: 黑体;  min-height: 16.00pt;  font-size: 16.00pt;  background-color: #FFFFFF;}span.docx_5 {  font-family: Times New Roman;  font-weight: bold;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">为引导广大学子爱读书、读好书、善读书，以经典阅读培育积极人生态度，赋能成长成才，4月22日，在第31个世界读书日来临之际，学生资助管理中心举办第九期“资助育人・悦读会”。学生资助宣传大使代表、阅读爱好者共计30余人，共同品读红色经典《苦难辉煌》，在回望峥嵘岁月中感悟信仰力量，在书香浸润中砥砺青春担当。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 300.95pt; height: 169.05pt;"><img src="/__local/6/B1/C6/611528BF8EF2DE1355EF3705D38_50B9C965_26C1F.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/6B1C6611528BF8EF2DE1355EF3705D38/50B9C965/26C1F" vheight=" 169.05pt" vwidth=" 300.95pt" orisrc="/__local/9/D1/D3/CBA7A3FBDC207839464FDBC2E70_AC6A5994_758C9.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 300.95pt; height: 169.05pt;"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">活动伊始，经济与管理学院周佳琦同学介绍了选取书籍的创作背景及主要内容，并播放书目导读视频，让在场同学对那段波澜壮阔的历史有了初步感知。沉浸式阅读前，大家围绕书中重大历史事件设题现场抢答，以轻松且具知识性的互动，加深同学们对书中关键事件与精神内核的理解。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 219.75pt; height: 164.85pt;"><img src="/__local/7/F9/EC/49566B423F829BB5A226F32C8EA_ADBA870F_ABAC.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/7F9EC49566B423F829BB5A226F32C8EA/ADBA870F/ABAC" vheight=" 164.85pt" vwidth=" 219.75pt" orisrc="/__local/C/9B/16/499AD1819A834B5C47AFFF3B64C_7445665D_A31E.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 219.75pt; height: 164.85pt;"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">经典回顾与感悟分享环节，同学们深情朗读书中打动自己的段落，结合自身成长经历、学习生活与青春困惑，畅谈从革命先辈的信仰与坚守中获得的精神启迪。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学生资助宣传大使李震华分享道：“看到陈毅元帅腿骨粉碎性骨折后，靠在树上咬牙挤出碎骨的场景，我感受到的不仅是个人的顽强，更是我们党在最艰难岁月里百折不挠、向死而生的精神写照”。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 183.7pt; height: 137.7pt;"><img src="/__local/E/2C/16/E92D237BD6824ABA81BE69F3C56_36FA96BC_1E14A.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/E2C16E92D237BD6824ABA81BE69F3C56/36FA96BC/1E14A" vheight=" 137.7pt" vwidth=" 183.7pt" orisrc="/__local/8/75/14/3A749E95D6B924A5F8CBC9B714C_282CA53B_1D8C5.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 183.7pt; height: 137.7pt;"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">通信工程学院师睿敏同学感叹道：“我真正看懂了第五次反‘围剿’为什么会失败，盲目照搬远方的‘经验’只会迷失方向。作为新时代青年，我将结合自身实际合理规划，走出属于自己的成长之路”。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 130.3pt; height: 173.9pt;"><img src="/__local/5/66/E7/63D4DE54ED2B4FB23A27776D270_02E9C844_3CE0.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/566E763D4DE54ED2B4FB23A27776D270/02E9C844/3CE0" vheight=" 173.9pt" vwidth=" 130.3pt" orisrc="/__local/5/66/E7/63D4DE54ED2B4FB23A27776D270_02E9C844_3CE0.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 130.3pt; height: 173.9pt;"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">阅读爱好者焦亦嶶同学感慨道：“苦难之中，最可怕的是自己看不清主要问题。面对学业、就业等压力，唯有沉下心来，理清方向，才能直面困难、解决问题”。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 182.9pt; height: 137.25pt;"><img src="/__local/8/5F/CD/5C7FEA360B30C17DF10B123FEBB_F623132A_1C4BE.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/85FCD5C7FEA360B30C17DF10B123FEBB/F623132A/1C4BE" vheight=" 137.25pt" vwidth=" 182.9pt" orisrc="/__local/8/37/90/29ADA510462693ECD2133EF9566_C70BFF80_1BEF0.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 182.9pt; height: 137.25pt;"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">方寸寄情，薪火相传。活动最后，同学们亲手制作漆画书签，以非遗技艺勾勒红色初心。一笔一画间，写下对革命先辈的崇高敬意与自己的青春誓言，将红色精神凝于纸端，许下传承使命、砥砺前行的坚定承诺。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 137.05pt; height: 182.85pt;"><img src="/__local/E/C5/2C/236F27852315E432C6326EA87F0_7A7E930F_2C61E.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/EC52C236F27852315E432C6326EA87F0/7A7E930F/2C61E" vheight=" 182.85pt" vwidth=" 137.05pt" orisrc="/__local/E/31/63/0A52C5AE6727C0BDE4CEF88B53A_43372179_2C09F.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 137.05pt; height: 182.85pt;"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">今年正值中国工农红军长征胜利九十周年，依托世界读书日共读《苦难辉煌》，穿越历史烟云，触摸那段浴血奋进的岁月，从中汲取信仰的力量。身为新时代西电学子，当勇担时代重任，传承红色血脉，以青春之力笃行奋进，为实现中华民族伟大复兴的中国梦不懈求索。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span id="_GoBack"></span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 244pt; height: 182.85pt;"><img src="/__local/6/08/B3/BFD0207460416F0E9A1B349F4FD_D95E0D18_FF2F.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/608B3BFD0207460416F0E9A1B349F4FD/D95E0D18/FF2F" vheight=" 182.85pt" vwidth=" 244pt" orisrc="/__local/E/8A/3E/E4A54C412E70E336606135AD328_4DD0B4E0_F18B.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 244pt; height: 182.85pt;"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">“资助育人·悦读会”系列活动是学校FAST发展型资助育人体系的特色活动，引导学生通过读书体悟文化意涵，涵养精神境界，将书中知识内化为指引人生道路的灯塔。下一步，学校将以学生成长发展为目标，结合筑梦行动，开展学生自我发展计划，持续打造多项成长引育行动。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 252.7pt; height: 189.55pt;"><img src="/__local/9/E3/4F/6CC1B92FBD4A59F179CBD535C20_E729DB5A_26C1D.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/9E34F6CC1B92FBD4A59F179CBD535C20/E729DB5A/26C1D" vheight=" 189.55pt" vwidth=" 252.7pt" orisrc="/__local/E/5B/04/CFFE47D15E583A435EADACAEAA9_C994B560_25D6A.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 252.7pt; height: 189.55pt;"></span></span></p></article></section>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
